<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Semiconductor Jan-Nov sales up.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Semiconductor Jan-Nov sales up.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Corp, Taiwan's top chipmaker, said on Monday its combined sales revenue from January to November totalled T$36.816 billion, up 41.3 percent from the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>In November alone, sales were T$2.815 billion, down 5.8 percent from November 1995.</p>
<p>It gave no profit figures. ($1 = T$27.5)</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (25080815)</p>
</text>
